      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yeah, I've pretty much confirmed it firsthand that when it occurs naturally its always the host, but I don't know when its triggered by force if a requirement is being the host, it's still a pain that its now being intentionally used, but I don't think they need to be host to force the issue.",
