      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I usually try to tell people \"don't mess with the objects, they'll crash everyone in the room.\" do half the people listen? no, but at least I warned them.\nI think 'floating' or 'nonphysics' objects seem not to cause this to happen as fast as a world full of objects with rigidbodies.\nthis isn't udon exclusive, it may be more prevalent in udon worlds, but it's just an issue across the board.",
